mpledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"🎥 Thanks for watching the FPL Tom YouTube Channel!\n\nYour go-to spot for all things Fantasy Premier League (FPL) — from tips and team reveals to strategy deep dives and weekly updates. ⚽🔥\n\n👇 Follow \u0026 Connect with Me:\n\n🐦 Twitter / X: https://x.com/FPLTom_\n\n🎵 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@fpltom__?is_f...\n\n📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fpltom_/?hl=en\n\n💡 Useful FPL Links:\n\n💬 NEXT XI PLANNING TOOL: https://nextxi.app/?via=FPLTOM\n\n💬FFS: https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.u...\n\n🧠 Elevnify: https://www.elevenify.com/\n\n💬 Join the FPL Cartel Community: https://sublaunch.com/fplcartel\n\n💬The Fantasy Tool: https://thefantasytool.com/player-pic...\n\n💬FPL Review: https://app.fplreview.com/\n\n💬 Solio: https://fpl.solioanalytics.com/\n\n\n\n👇 Don’t forget to like 👍, subscribe 🔔, and comment 💬 to support the channel and stay up to date with the latest FPL content!\n\nTimecodes\n0:00 = Intro \n\n\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #premierleague #fantasyfootball","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":236,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwjWtqKU8quWAxU9Q8MAHZV9JixI_qLzx_Ck8beIAcoBBDPYI2w=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU2RPRmhsWV9WMUptOTlXc0pfZnZISHxBR3JiS2FuSmdaTWhCdnAyNVRHN2pmaG0tZS1DOFhzRUVpQmNvSEp1SEQ0c0psODR3VmRUVlJhUXcwZ0UtX2pEYVROa1FQaWphbng1czEzeTlTSjBDdzFqOE9zTkpJelNLeUpk\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FFPLTom_\u0026v=iG_FJwj80X4","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU2RPRmhsWV9WMUptOTlXc0pfZnZISHxBR3JiS2FuSmdaTWhCdnAyNVRHN2pmaG0tZS1DOFhzRUVpQmNvSEp1SEQ0c0psODR3VmRUVlJhUXcwZ0UtX2pEYVROa1FQaWphbng1czEzeTlTSjBDdzFqOE9zTkpJelNLeUpk\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FFPLTom_\u0026v=iG_FJwj80X4","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":270,"lengt